      "Complete the sentences with can, can't, could or couldn't and the verb in brackets.": "Completa le frasi con can, can't, could o couldn't e il verbo tra parentesi.",
      "Complete the sentences with the correct form of have to and the verb in brackets.": "Completa le frasi con la forma corretta di have to e il verbo tra parentesi.",
      "Complete the sentences with mustn't, don't / doesn't have to or didn't have to.": "Completa le frasi con mustn't, don't / doesn't have to o didn't have to.",
      "Read the whole text first, then complete each gap with mustn't, don't have to or have to.": "Leggi prima tutto il testo, poi completa ogni spazio con mustn't, don't have to o have to.",
      "Complete the sentences with need to, needs to, don't need to, needn't or didn't need to and the verb in brackets.": "Completa le frasi con need to, needs to, don't need to, needn't o didn't need to e il verbo tra parentesi.",
